  notes: NBRC1226 first dissolves NTA in200ml water and adjusts pH6.5 with KOH; that200ml is part of the
    listed preparation water, not an additional2nd water input. KOH amount/strength and final analytical
    species are unspecified, so closure is UNKNOWN. The parent medium uses1ml of this stock. Iron is explicitly
    FeCl3 hexahydrate, distinguishing this stock from JCM1435 FeCl2 tetrahydrate.
